{"product_id":"shadow-rider-a-shadow-riders-novel","title":"Shadow Rider (A Shadow Riders Novel)","description":"\u003cp\u003eThe #1 New York Times bestselling “queen of paranormal romance” (USA Today) is back with a sexy series starring a Chicago crime family that hides a dark, mystical secret...Whether it’s fast cars or fast women, Stefano Ferraro gets what he wants. When he’s not fodder for the paparazzi, he commands Ferraro family businesses—both legitimate and illegitimate.While their criminal activity is simply a rumor yet to be proven, no one knows the real truth. The Ferraros are a family of shadow riders capable of manipulating light and dark, an ability Stefano thought ran in his family alone—until now…With little left to her name, Francesca Cappello has come to Chicago in hopes of a new life. She wasn’t expecting to attract the attention of a man with primal hunger in his eyes, driven to claim her as his to protect and to please. And if he discovers her secret, it could ruin her...\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 105 x 171\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Christine Feehan\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9780515156133\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Mass Market Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 480\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookhero.ae","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45434479345817,"sku":"12RB9780515156133","price":10.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/683aee22a40a8_Shadow_Rider__A_Shadow_Riders_Novel__Christine_Feehan.jpg?v=1748708055","url":"https:\/\/bookhero.ae\/products\/shadow-rider-a-shadow-riders-novel","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}